Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Channel mobility improvement involved?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 74, "text": "**The Breakthrough: Unleashing the Power of Channel Mobility Improvement**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 76, "end": 144, "text": "In the world of technology, innovation is the lifeblood of progress."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 145, "end": 338, "text": "And in the realm of semiconductor manufacturing, the quest for faster, more efficient, and more reliable devices has driven researchers and engineers to push the boundaries of what is possible."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 339, "end": 484, "text": "One such breakthrough, patented as US 11430867, revolutionized the industry by introducing a game-changing concept: channel mobility improvement."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 485, "end": 663, "text": "At the heart of this innovation was a team of brilliant minds, driven by the pursuit of excellence and the desire to overcome the limitations of traditional semiconductor design."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 664, "end": 822, "text": "For years, they had been grappling with the constraints of channel mobility, a critical factor in determining the speed and performance of electronic devices."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 823, "end": 981, "text": "The challenge was clear: how to improve channel mobility without sacrificing other essential characteristics, such as power consumption and thermal stability."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 982, "end": 1079, "text": "The eureka moment came when the team discovered a novel approach to channel mobility improvement."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1080, "end": 1260, "text": "By carefully calibrating the doping profiles and optimizing the gate stack architecture, they were able to significantly enhance the mobility of charge carriers within the channel."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1261, "end": 1442, "text": "This breakthrough had far-reaching implications, enabling the creation of faster, more efficient, and more reliable devices that would transform the landscape of modern electronics."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1443, "end": 1501, "text": "But the journey to success was not without its challenges."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1502, "end": 1617, "text": "The team faced numerous obstacles, from the complexities of materials science to the intricacies of device physics."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1618, "end": 1761, "text": "They had to navigate the treacherous waters of patent law, ensuring that their innovation was protected and their intellectual property secure."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1762, "end": 1866, "text": "And, of course, there was the daunting task of convincing the industry of the merits of their discovery."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1867, "end": 1935, "text": "It was in this context that the significant event filing took place."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1936, "end": 2062, "text": "The legal filing, a crucial step in the patent process, marked a turning point in the journey of channel mobility improvement."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2063, "end": 2183, "text": "It was a testament to the team's perseverance, creativity, and dedication to pushing the boundaries of what is possible."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2184, "end": 2341, "text": "The evidence was clear: channel mobility improvement was not just a theoretical concept, but a tangible reality with the potential to transform the industry."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2342, "end": 2492, "text": "The patent filing provided a detailed roadmap of the innovation, outlining the specific techniques and methodologies used to achieve the breakthrough."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2493, "end": 2674, "text": "It was a masterclass in engineering and materials science, offering a glimpse into the intricate dance of electrons and atoms that underpinned the functioning of modern electronics."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2675, "end": 2734, "text": "As the news of the patent spread, the industry took notice."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2735, "end": 2916, "text": "Manufacturers and researchers alike began to explore the possibilities of channel mobility improvement, recognizing the vast potential of this innovation to revolutionize the field."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 59, "text": "Channel Mobility Improvement and Its Role in Ship Launching"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 61, "end": 228, "text": "Channel mobility improvement refers to the enhancement of a waterway's navigability and efficiency, allowing for smoother and more efficient transportation of vessels."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 229, "end": 346, "text": "This concept has been instrumental in various maritime operations, including the significant event of ship launching."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 347, "end": 386, "text": "History of Channel Mobility Improvement"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 387, "end": 423, "text": "------------------------------------"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 425, "end": 627, "text": "The concept of channel mobility improvement dates back to the early 20th century, when the United States Army Corps of Engineers conducted a series of studies on the optimization of waterway navigation."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 628, "end": 851, "text": "One of the pioneering studies in this field was the \"Navigation Channel Improvement Study\" conducted in 1923, which highlighted the importance of channel mobility in reducing transit times and increasing cargo capacity (1)."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 852, "end": 981, "text": "In the 1950s, the development of advanced dredging technologies further accelerated the progress of channel mobility improvement."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 982, "end": 1151, "text": "The introduction of hydraulic dredgers and suction dredgers enabled the removal of sediment and debris from waterways, significantly improving navigation conditions (2)."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1152, "end": 1174, "text": "Role in Ship Launching"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1175, "end": 1196, "text": "---------------------"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1198, "end": 1292, "text": "Channel mobility improvement played a crucial role in the significant event of ship launching."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1293, "end": 1482, "text": "The process of transferring a vessel to the water requires a high degree of precision and control, and channel mobility improvement ensured that the waterway was optimized for this process."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1483, "end": 1610, "text": "Studies have shown that channel mobility improvement reduced the time and cost associated with ship launching by up to 30% (3)."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1611, "end": 1783, "text": "This was achieved through the creation of a more stable and predictable waterway environment, which enabled shipbuilders to launch vessels with greater ease and efficiency."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1784, "end": 1800, "text": "Notable Examples"}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1801, "end": 1817, "text": "----------------"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1819, "end": 1938, "text": "One notable example of channel mobility improvement in ship launching is the launch of the USS Nimitz (CVN-68) in 1972."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1939, "end": 2118, "text": "The construction of this aircraft carrier required significant channel mobility improvements to the waterway, including the dredging of over 1 million cubic yards of sediment (4)."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2119, "end": 2359, "text": "Another example is the launch of the Queen Mary 2 in 2003, which was facilitated by a comprehensive channel mobility improvement program that included the installation of advanced navigation aids and the removal of underwater obstacles (5)."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2360, "end": 2370, "text": "References"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2371, "end": 2381, "text": "----------"}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2383, "end": 2425, "text": "(1) United States Army Corps of Engineers."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2426, "end": 2433, "text": "(1923)."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2434, "end": 2471, "text": "Navigation Channel Improvement Study."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2472, "end": 2517, "text": "Washington, D.C.: Government Printing Office."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2518, "end": 2570, "text": "(2) International Association of Dredging Companies."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2571, "end": 2578, "text": "(1955)."}, "D2S29": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2579, "end": 2611, "text": "Advances in Dredging Technology."}, "D2S30": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2612, "end": 2641, "text": "The Hague, Netherlands: IADC."}, "D2S31": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2642, "end": 2674, "text": "(3) Maritime Research Institute."}, "D2S32": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2675, "end": 2682, "text": "(2010)."}, "D2S33": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2683, "end": 2744, "text": "The Impact of Channel Mobility Improvement on Ship Launching."}, "D2S34": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2745, "end": 2773, "text": "Rotterdam, Netherlands: MRI."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "patent filing", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Channel mobility improvement", "scope": "significant event", "claim": "The significant event in which Channel mobility improvement was involved was the patent filing.", "answer": "patent filing", "quote": "It was in this context that the significant event filing took place. The legal filing, a crucial step in the patent process, marked a turning point in the journey of channel mobility improvement.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["patent filing", "ship launching"]}
